<div class="wrap prose">
  <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-red">Legal</div>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="lede">This explains what we do with the details you send us through this website, and what you can ask us to do about them.</p>
  <p class="updated">Last updated 3 September 2026</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>{{ site.name }} is the data controller for the information described here. If you have a question about your details, or want us to delete them, contact {{ site.owner }}:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
    <li>Phone <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneLink }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Only what you type into the enquiry form on our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name</li>
    <li>Your phone number</li>
    <li>Your email address, if you give one</li>
    <li>The address of the roof, if you give one</li>
    <li>The type of job and how soon you need it</li>
    <li>Whatever you write in the message box</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not use cookies, analytics or tracking of any kind on this website. We do not build a profile of you, and nothing you do here is used for advertising.</p>

  <h2>Why we hold it, and on what basis</h2>
  <p>We use your details to answer your enquiry, to come and look at the roof, and to give you a price. That is all.</p>
  <p>Our lawful basis is that processing is necessary to take steps at your request before entering into a contract, and our legitimate interest in responding to people who ask us to quote for work.</p>

  <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
  <p>As few people as possible:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Netlify</strong> hosts this website and receives the enquiry form, storing it so we can read it.</li>
    <li><strong>Spacemail</strong> carries the email notification of your enquiry to us.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> serves the typefaces this site uses. Your browser requests them from Google, which means Google receives your IP address when a page loads. Nothing you type is sent to Google.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your details, we do not pass them to other trades, and we do not add you to a mailing list.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>If your enquiry does not lead to work, we delete it within twelve months. If we do carry out work for you, we keep the records for six years, because tax and insurance rules require it.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under UK data protection law you can ask us to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>tell you what we hold about you, and give you a copy</li>
    <li>correct anything that is wrong</li>
    <li>delete it</li>
    <li>stop using it, or restrict how we use it</li>
    <li>send it to you or someone else in a portable form</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Just ask {{ site.owner }} using the details above and we will sort it out. There is no charge, and we will respond within a month.</p>
  <p>If you are not happy with how we have handled your information, you can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint</a> or on 0303 123 1113.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change how we handle your details we will update this page and change the date at the top.</p>
</div>
